@startuml
title Comment Service — command and read flow
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Comment Controller" as API
participant "Comment Use Case" as UseCase
participant "PostAvailabilityPort\nFeign adapter" as PostPort
participant "Post Service" as Post
database "Comment DB" as DB

User -> Gateway : POST /comment/api/v1/comments\nJWT + postId + parentId? + content
Gateway -> API : X-Auth-User-Id from JWT\nX-Correlation-Id
API -> UseCase : CreateCommentCommand(actor, post, parent?, content)
UseCase -> PostPort : ensureCommentable(postId, actorId)
PostPort -> Post : GET post availability

alt Post missing or unavailable for business action
  Post --> PostPort : 404 / classified unavailable
  PostPort --> UseCase : domain not-found/conflict
  UseCase --> API : no local write
  API --> Gateway : 404 or 409 + traceId
  Gateway --> User : error response
else timeout, network error or provider 5xx
  PostPort -> Post : one bounded retry when safe
  PostPort --> UseCase : DependencyUnavailable
  UseCase --> API : fail closed
  API --> Gateway : 503 + traceId
  Gateway --> User : error response
else Post is commentable
  Post --> PostPort : available
  opt Reply
    UseCase -> DB : load parent
    DB --> UseCase : parent
    note right of UseCase
      Same post
      Top-level parent only
      Parent must not be deleted
    end note
  end
  UseCase -> DB : INSERT comment/reply
  DB --> UseCase : saved comment
  UseCase --> API : CommentResponse
  API --> Gateway : 201 + X-Correlation-Id
  Gateway --> User : created response
end

== Local commands do not require Post ==
User -> Gateway : PATCH or DELETE /comment/api/v1/comments/{id}
Gateway -> API : trusted actor
API -> UseCase : edit/delete(commentId, actor)
UseCase -> DB : load + enforce owner + local transaction
DB --> UseCase : updated / idempotently deleted
UseCase --> API : command result
API --> Gateway : 200
Gateway --> User : response

== Local reads remain available during Post outage ==
User -> Gateway : GET discussion / count
Gateway -> API : request
API -> DB : paged visible comments or grouped counts
DB --> API : active rows; deleted parent placeholder if replies exist
API --> Gateway : 200
Gateway --> User : response
@enduml
